          "comment": "# Comfy Bria- Virtual Try-On\n\nDress the person in a photo with a garment from a separate product shot using Bria. One person photo plus one to three garments or accessories produces a worn look in which the face, pose and background stay untouched and the garment is refitted to the body. Ideal for fashion catalogs and lookbooks without a photoshoot. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_bria_virtual_try_on.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
